'''Araxxor'''

* The new Slayer boss, Araxxor, is here at last!
* Players with at least Level 92 Slayer can obtain an Araxyte task from Nieve or Duradel, then take Araxxor on in the Araxyte Nest between Slepe and Ver Sinhaza.
* Various smaller Araxytes have been added for players looking for a quicker task, and have a Superior variant of their own.
* The Araxyte Slayer Helmet, Jar of Venom, Araxxor pet, Noxious Halberd, Amulet of Rancour, Araxyte Venom Sac and some new teleport scrolls have been added as rewards from Araxxor. Aranea Boots have been added as a reward from regular Araxytes.

'''Summer Summit 2024'''

* Mark your calendars for '''September 7th, 8pm BST / 3pm ET / 12pm PT''' for all the exciting news this year’s Summer Summit will bring!

'''Other Changes'''

* Boss tasks that can only be completed solo (e.g. Zulrah, Cerberus, Kraken) now award the correct amount of points if you're on a task with a Slayer Partner.
* Osmumten's Fang's inventory icon is no longer missing an outline pixel at the sword's tip.
* Legacy Duels at the Emir's Arena are now restricted to specific 'Legacy Duels' worlds.
* Players can no longer walk through Jimmy Dazzler's walls. Don't ask...

